{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"2\n    \n      Cost Visibility & Attribution MVP\n      Our existing strength, extended. Cost Explorer by service/tag/account/region, instance-level attribution (EC2/EBS/RDS/ELB/EIP — we already do this better than the ref tool). Extend to S3, Lambda, DynamoDB, NAT, CloudFront, data transfer. 6-month trend charts. Forecast. Tag-value filtering.","choice":"2-visibility","id":null,"timestamp":1776875475841}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"3\n    \n      FinOps Audit Engine MVP\n      Biggest gap vs ref tool. Untagged resources (all services/regions), idle/unused (stopped EC2, unattached EBS, unused EIPs, orphaned snapshots, old AMIs, idle RDS, idle ELBs), budget breach detection, tagging policy violations. Per-region sweeps with parallel fetches.","choice":"3-audit","id":null,"timestamp":1776875481022}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"6\n    \n      Reporting & Distribution MVP\n      PDF / CSV / JSON export (more polish than ref tool), scheduled reports (cron-style, runs locally or in user's Lambda), Slack & Teams integration, S3 archival, SES/SMTP email delivery. Shareable, printable, auditable outputs.","choice":"6-report","id":null,"timestamp":1776875492467}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"7\n    \n      Web UI & UX MVP\n      Modern SPA dashboard. Views: Cost Explorer, Trends, Audit, Resources drill-down, Recommendations, Settings. Multi-account rollup. Profile/region switcher. Dark mode. Interactive charts with drill-down. Design-led, not generic AI aesthetic.","choice":"7-webui","id":null,"timestamp":1776875504249}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"8\n    \n      Distribution, Packaging & Install MVP\n      pipx install aws-cost-ultra, Docker image, optional PyInstaller binary. First-run wizard (auto-detect AWS profiles, pick region scope, seed SQLite). Auto-update check. Opt-in anonymized telemetry. This is what makes it feel like a product, not a script.","choice":"8-dist","id":null,"timestamp":1776875507307}
